      "source": "Private Sub Workbook_BeforeSave(ByVal SaveAsUI As Boolean, Cancel As Boolean)\r\n    SaveCalls = SaveCalls + 1\r\n    SaveUiSeen = SaveAsUI\r\n    Cancel = True\r\nEnd Sub\r\n",
